WEBVTT

00:13:57.258 --> 00:14:00.488
hit the top five in nine others.

00:14:00.488 --> 00:14:03.255
Something in us, I think, is crying out

00:14:03.255 --> 00:14:07.761
for the sense of intimacy and depth
that we get from people like that.

00:14:07.761 --> 00:14:11.543
who take the time
and trouble to sit still.

00:14:11.543 --> 00:14:13.781
And I think many
of us have the sensation,

00:14:13.781 --> 00:14:15.309
I certainly do,

00:14:15.309 --> 00:14:19.758
that we're standing about two inches away
from a huge screen,

00:14:19.767 --> 00:14:21.605
and it's noisy and it's crowded

00:14:21.605 --> 00:14:23.781
and it's changing with every second,

00:14:23.781 --> 00:14:26.530
and that screen is our lives.

00:14:26.530 --> 00:14:30.153
And it's only by stepping back,
and then further back,